<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6170] JDBC: consistent product name across all drivers</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6170</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We have 3 JDBC drivers. Some of them report &lt;tt&gt;DatabaseMetaData#getDatabaseProductName&lt;/tt&gt; as &lt;b&gt;Ignite&lt;/b&gt;, others as &lt;b&gt;Ignite Cache&lt;/b&gt;. Neither are correct. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It should be &lt;b&gt;Apache Ignite&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
